[Verse 1]
[00:00.74]Midnight driving in a ghost town
[00:04.47]Windows up, watching the rain come down
[00:08.12]Got a pocket full of dreams and a heart of stone
[00:12.33]Everything I built, I’m standing here alone
[00:15.56]Yeah, the gold on my neck feels heavy tonight
[00:19.60]Chasing a ghost in the pale moonlight

[Pre-Chorus]
[00:24.10]The static in my head is getting loud
[00:27.80]I’m looking for a way to break this cloud
[00:33.12]Yeah, it’s coming...
[00:35.30]Three, two, one...

[Chorus]
[00:37.28]Diamond ruins in a desert of neon
[00:40.89]Trying to find a soul for me to lean on
[00:44.38]I’m fading out, yeah I’m almost gone
[00:48.58]But the beat keeps moving, moving on
(Yeah, it keeps moving on)

[Verse 2]
[01:08.61]Twenty racks just to feel a little spark
[01:12.11]But I’m still dancing alone in the dark
[01:15.44]System overload, I’m losing the fight
[01:19.21]Another hollow victory under the lights
[01:23.21]But I don't care, no I don't mind
[01:27.09]Leave the world and the pain behind

[Bridge]
[01:32.89]Am I human? Or just a ghost in the machine?
[01:39.83]Stuck in the silence, somewhere in between...
(Bring it back!)

[Chorus]
[01:47.85]Diamond ruins in a desert of neon
[01:54.73]Trying to find a soul for me to lean on
[01:58.25]I’m fading out, yeah I’m almost gone
[02:02.44]But the beat keeps moving, moving on

[Outro]
[02:09.51]Moving on...
Yeah...
